OL,3,GNEWSAThe great neighbour at the heart
OL,4,Aof Plumbridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo quote the theme tune to a well-known
OL,7,Fformer Australian soap, "everybody
OL,8,Fneeds good neighbours" and for older
OL,9,Fpeople in Plumbridge they don't come
OL,10,Fbetter than Anne Bradley.
OL,12,FLocated in the heart of the Sperrin
OL,13,Fmountains between Strabane and Omagh,
OL,14,Flife in the rural village and
OL,15,Fsurrounding area can be peaceful but,
OL,16,Fwhen combined with the challenges of
OL,17,Fgrowing older, it can be lonely.
OL,19,FFor more than 26 years Anne has been
OL,20,Ftrying to improve the lives of older
OL,21,Fpeople in the community through the
OL,22,FPlum Club which she founded in 2000.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
