OL,3,GNEWSAThe great neighbour at the heart
OL,4,Aof Plumbridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Tyrone woman has been shortlisted
OL,7,Ffor a BBC Make a Difference Award in
OL,8,Fthe Great Neighbour category.
